            <ArticleTitle>Chronic low back pain: evaluation and therapy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>116-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Chronic low back pain is a common complaint afflicting a large percentage of the population. More interest is required in solving this problem, which is of large economic proportions. This paper reports some procedures by which this may be achieved.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
